+| **cross_doc_link**| **0.253** [.245,.262] n=10042 | 0.435 [.418,.452] n=3270 | 0.498 [.473,.520] n=1838 | **0.281** [.262,.298] n=2376 | 0.180 [.144,.210] n=500 | 0.493 [.463,.522] n=1267 | - |
