+---
+
+## Headline findings so far
+
+- **Cross-doc attention shows real signal** on the two benchmarks built to test
+  it: wiki `hotpotqa_cross_doc` (−14.3% NLL vs flat). thestack
+  `repobench_cross_doc` pending.
+- **thestack doc_causal** is the only model clearly above chance on a discrete
+  benchmark (humaneval_buggy 0.61).
+- **Wiki commonsense MC is at chance** across the board — expected for 1-epoch
+  models; these benchmarks likely need much more training (or aren't the right
